Not prohibited: viewing and forking this repository on GitHub as far as GitHub's Terms of
Service allow (the prohibition above continues to apply to forks); viewing the published
website in a browser; and uses the law permits, such as quotation.

The narration audio was synthesized with VOICEVOX (voice: 四国めたん, credit
"VOICEVOX:四国めたん") and is also subject to the VOICEVOX terms of use and the terms of
that voice library; see decks/llm/voice/README.md. The typefaces of the published site are
IBM Plex (SIL Open Font License 1.1), taken from npm at build time. Development
dependencies remain under their own licenses.
